.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrcat()
appends a copy of the string pointed to by
.I src
to the end of the string pointed to by
.IR dest .
The caller must ensure
.I dest
has enough allocated space to hold the combined result.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, and \-1 on failure.
